    "bug_id": "Lang-21",
    "project": "Lang",
    "summary": "DateUtils.isSameLocalTime does not work correct",
    "description": "Hi, I think I found a bug in the DateUtils class in the method isSameLocalTime.\n\nExample: \n\nCalendar a = Calendar.getInstance();\n\na.setTimeInMillis(1297364400000L);\n\nCalendar b = Calendar.getInstance();\n\nb.setTimeInMillis(1297321200000L);\n\nAssert.assertFalse(DateUtils.isSameLocalTime(a, b));\n\nThis is because the method compares \n\ncal1.get(Calendar.HOUR) == cal2.get(Calendar.HOUR) \n\nbut I think it has to be \n\ncal1.get(Calendar.HOUR_OF_DAY) == cal2.get(Calendar.HOUR_OF_DAY)"
  },
